<h1 id="summary">Summary</h1>

<p>Those are the code examples for several different ways to detect shake-like or shake-to-activate functions. Take what you need: for something more complex, choose CMMotionManager; if you just want a simple shake, just use the system event; use UIAcceleration in non-standard cases.</p>

<p>Of course, you can also wrap all three approaches and use an internal switch to control which one is used.</p>

